.TH EFFECTCRAFT 1 "November 2026" "EffectCraft" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
effectcraft \- open-source motion graphics and compositing editor
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B effectcraft
.RI [ options ]
.RI [ file ...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B effectcraft
starts EffectCraft, a native application written in Rust. It has layers with keyframes, masks, shapes, text animators, expressions, 3D cameras and lights, effects and a render queue. Projects (.ecproj) and media files given on the command line are opened.
.PP
Headless work (running commands, rendering, the MCP server) is done by
.BR effectcraft-cli (1).
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-version
Print the version and exit.
.TP
.BI "\-\-control " PORT
Start a localhost JSON-lines control server on
.IR PORT ,
which lets
.B "effectcraft-cli mcp"
attach to the running window.
.PP
.B effectcraft \-\-help
or the program's usage text lists the remaining options.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR effectcraft-cli (1)
.PP
https://getartcraft.com/apps/effectcraft
